This application needs IBM's MQ client, which is not included in this zip.
Download com.ibm.mq.allclient.jar from Maven Central and save it in the "lib" directory as "com.ibm.mq.allclient.jar":
https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/com/ibm/mq/com.ibm.mq.allclient/9.4.1.0/com.ibm.mq.allclient-9.4.1.0.jar
Then run start.sh (start.cmd on Windows).
Tutorial: https://github.com/trafficparrot/trafficparrot-demo-applications/tree/master/mobile-network-hardware
